{"title":"The Widmoria Muster","main_story":{"headline":"Dungeon Muster at Widmoria as Tier 1 Work Looms Large","lede":"An evening expedition assembled itself in open chat while a parallel discussion returned to the scale of Tier 1 work.","body":"The evening's main event assembled itself over open chat. **Aryn** placed the Widmoria dungeon southeast of Grand Exchange. **Archaelic** confessed, "Would love to join, just dont have any plate." **TinyHouseGamer** asked which Tier 7 target it would be, with the jungle dungeon still an open question.

The region was watching its neighbors too. **TinyHouseGamer** noted that "damn R9 is doing T7 dungeons atm". **KeyserSoze** answered the scheduling problem with a jab at Aryn for overlapping unknown plans in other regions.

The day's other seminar was economics. **HereticalSage** did the arithmetic, "so in the end game you need thousands of t1s"."}}
